      * RPG II MOVE and MOVEL (FREE-08)
     H
     FCUSTMAS IF         80  6AI     1 DISK
     ICUSTMAS AA
     I                                        1   60CUSTNO
     I                                        7  26 NAME
     I                                       27  31 CODE
     I                                       32  370ACCT
     I                                    P  38  422BAL
      * Alphanumeric to alphanumeric, same length and a result field with a length
     C                     MOVE NAME      NAME2  20
      * MOVE: longer field, shorter field, padding with P
     C                     MOVE NAME      CODE
     C                     MOVE CODE      NAME
     C                     MOVE CODE      NAME      P
      * MOVEL: longer field, shorter field, padding with P
     C                     MOVELNAME      CODE
     C                     MOVELCODE      NAME
     C                     MOVELCODE      NAME      P
      * Literals
     C                     MOVE 'AB'      CODE
     C                     MOVEL'ABCDE'   CODE
      * Figurative constants
     C                     MOVE *BLANK    NAME
     C                     MOVE *ZERO     ACCT
     C                     MOVE *ZEROS    CODE
      * Numeric to numeric, same length and decimal positions
     C                     MOVE CUSTNO    ACCT
      * Not converted
     C                     MOVE CUSTNO    NAME
     C                     MOVE NAME      CUSTNO
     C                     MOVE BAL       ACCT
     C                     MOVE 5         ACCT
     C                     MOVE UNKNWN    NAME
     C                     MOVE *HIVAL    NAME
     C                     MOVE CUSTNO    ACCT      P
     C                     MOVE CODE      NAME       90
